    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Yeah, the behavior part makes sense. I'll watch her movement. Is there any way to tell if there's like, a hidden infection or something basically \"undermining\" her from the inside? Like, things that just feel fundamentally wrong or wrong-feeling even if the physical vitals haven't crashed yet?",
